  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Fort Mumbai known for?",
      "answer": "Fort is known as Mumbai's historic commercial and legal district, home to the Bombay High Court, the Reserve Bank of India, the iconic Flora Fountain (Hutatma Chowk), Horniman Circle, Kala Ghoda's art district, Ballard Estate's colonial architecture and some of the finest heritage buildings in Asia. It is the original heart of Bombay."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Fort?",
      "answer": "Fort uses the pin code 400001 - the most prestigious pin code in Mumbai and one of the most recognisable in India."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Fort?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Fort are Ballard Estate, Horniman Circle, Flora Fountain (Hutatma Chowk), Kala Ghoda, Mint Road, Medows Street, Veer Nariman Road fringe, and the Bombay High Court belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Fort?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Fort are primarily commercial - office space ranges from ₹200 to ₹500 per sqft for lease. Residential properties are rare and range from ₹3–8 Cr for a 2BHK in the limited residential pockets. Rental rates for commercial space range from ₹80,000 to ₹5 lakh per month (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Fort?",
      "answer": "Fort is served by CST (Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Terminus) - the Central Railway terminus - and is walkable to Churchgate (Western Railway). BEST bus routes 1, 3, 63, 66, 83, 124 serve the area. Metro Line 3 has a station at CST. The area is also walkable to Colaba and Kalbadevi."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Fort?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals in and near Fort include St. George's Hospital, Bombay Hospital, J.J. Hospital, Wockhardt Hospital, and Saifee Hospital."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in Fort?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in Fort include Cathedral & John Connon School, St. Xavier's College, Elphinstone College, K.C. College, and the University of Mumbai (Fort Campus)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Fort?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Fort listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
